    "create_time": 1785894020.868,
    "update_time": 1785894024.5719953,
    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "```bash\n# 1. Xcode CLT + Homebrew\nxcode-select --install\n/bin/bash -c \"$(curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Homebrew/install/HEAD/install.sh)\"\necho 'eval \"$(/opt/homebrew/bin/brew shellenv)\"' >> ~/.zprofile && eval \"$(/opt/homebrew/bin/brew shellenv)\"\n\n# 2. Core tools\nbrew install git gh fnm uv ripgrep fd jq wget\nbrew install --cask visual-studio-code iterm2 rectangle\n\n# 3. Node via fnm\necho 'eval \"$(fnm env --use-on-cd)\"' >> ~/.zshrc\nfnm install --lts && fnm default lts-latest\n\n# 4. Python via uv\nuv python install 3.12\n\n# 5. Git identity + SSH\ngit config --global user.name \"David Barron\"\ngit config --global user.email \"<your email>\"\ngit config --global init.defaultBranch main\nssh-keygen -t ed25519 -C \"<your email>\"\ngh auth login   # uploads the key\n\n# 6. Claude Code\nnpm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code\n```\n\nThen: restore dotfiles if you have a repo, turn on FileVault, set key repeat fast (`defaults write -g KeyRepeat -int 2`), and sign into VS Code settings sync."
     ]
    },
