     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "It needs a logout/login (or restart) to take effect. Also set the initial delay:\n\n```bash\ndefaults write -g InitialKeyRepeat -int 15\ndefaults write -g KeyRepeat -int 2\n```\n\nThen log out and back in. If it still doesn't apply, check System Settings → Keyboard: moving the sliders there overrides the defaults values."
     ]
